TABLE.COMMENT:
Slides within a live session — questions, polls, prompts.
                    Ordered by position (1, 2, 3, ...). Trainer advances
                    sessions.current_slide_id through the deck.

                    type column: multichoice / wordcloud / openended / rating /
                                 quiz / ranking. Each type gates on a feature
                                 flag (live.questiontype.{type}) at create time.

                    settings_json schema varies by type:
                      multichoice: {options: ['Yes', 'No', 'Maybe']}
                      rating:      {scale_min: 1, scale_max: 5, scale_labels: [...]}
                      quiz:        {options: [...], correct_index: 2}
                      ranking:     {items: [...]}
                      wordcloud:   {max_word_length: 50, dedupe: true}
                      openended:   {max_chars: 280}

Append-only event journal that drives the SSE stream.
                    The /stream.php endpoint polls
                      SELECT * WHERE sessionid = ? AND id > $last_event_id
                    every second and emits 'data: {payload}\n\n' lines.

                    Event types:
                      session_started — payload: {}
                      session_ended   — payload: {final_results: {...}}
                      slide_changed   — payload: {slide_id, position}
                      response_added  — payload: {slide_id, count_now}
                      participant_joined — payload: {participant_id, count_now}

                    Retention: a daily cron purges events older than 24h
                    after their session ended (or 72h if session is still
                    in live state — caps runaway sessions).
